+      // 光标不是从上次落点往后续写（点了别处 / 整段被替换），样式就不再跟随
+      if (startCursorPosition != pending.expected) {
+        iterator.remove()
+        continue
+      }
+
+      pending.span?.let { s.removeSpan(it) }
+      pending.span = null
+
+      val from = pending.start.coerceIn(0, s.length)
+      val to = endCursorPosition.coerceIn(0, s.length)
+      if (to > from) {
+        val span = pending.create()
+        s.setSpan(span, from, to, EnrichedSpanFlags.forSpan(span))
+        pending.span = span
+      }
+      pending.expected = endCursorPosition
+    }
+  }
+
+  private fun parseCssColor(raw: String): Int? =
+    try {
+      Color.parseColor(raw)
+    } catch (e: IllegalArgumentException) {
+      null
+    }
+
+  fun setTextColor(cssColor: String) {
+    applyCharacterStyle(
+      ForegroundColorSpan::class.java,
+      { it.foregroundColor },
+      { ForegroundColorSpan(it) },
+      if (cssColor.isEmpty()) null else parseCssColor(cssColor),
+    )
+  }
+
+  fun setTextBackgroundColor(cssColor: String) {
+    applyCharacterStyle(
+      BackgroundColorSpan::class.java,
+      { it.backgroundColor },
+      { BackgroundColorSpan(it) },
+      if (cssColor.isEmpty()) null else parseCssColor(cssColor),
+    )
+  }
+
+  fun setTextFontSize(sizeInDp: String) {
+    val size = sizeInDp.trim().toIntOrNull()
+    applyCharacterStyle(
+      AbsoluteSizeSpan::class.java,
+      { it.size },
+      { AbsoluteSizeSpan(it, true) },
+      if (size == null || size <= 0) null else size,
+    )
+  }
 }
